# Patterns here are NOT anchored to this directory — Vercel applies them across
# the whole clone, so a bare `tools/` also strips platform/tools. Anchor
# everything with a leading slash.
#
# Do NOT ignore src/. `npm run build` reads it, and Vercel runs that script
# during deploy. Ignoring it strips the sources and then runs the thing that
# reads them, which is exactly how this file broke the first deploy.
#
# lib/ is imported by the API functions and bundled with them; it is never served.

/test/
/tools/
/DESIGN.md
